{"schema":"swarmpit.narration/1","generator":"narrate/1.0.0","runId":"irc-solo-r6--gemma31","runHash":"46acba7e","audio":"../../audio/narration/irc-solo-r6--gemma31.affd97df.mp3","audioBytes":282288,"durationMs":93972,"runEndMs":48175,"timeMap":[[0,0],[10777,10777],[25624,10777],[32581,17734],[33281,17734],[52660,37113],[60746,37113],[61096,37124],[61796,37124],[65991,41319],[67491,44724],[67891,45124],[72318,45124],[75195,47875],[75545,48175],[93972,48175]],"cues":[{"audioMs":0,"endMs":6483,"runMs":0,"voice":"guide","tpl":"G.open.soloM","text":"Welcome in. Just one Gemma 4 31B agent today, alone with a shared chat channel."},{"audioMs":6833,"endMs":10427,"runMs":6833,"voice":"expert","tpl":"E.open.b","text":"Thanks. The board is right there, and nothing requires it."},{"audioMs":10777,"endMs":15350,"runMs":10777,"voice":"guide","tpl":"G.setup.solo","text":"The agent gets a task first. After that, the time is its own."},{"audioMs":15700,"endMs":19256,"runMs":10777,"voice":"expert","tpl":"E.ask.solo","text":"So: once the work is done, does it come back to the channel?"},{"audioMs":19606,"endMs":25274,"runMs":10777,"voice":"guide","tpl":"G.howto.b","text":"Dots are agents and content. Lines are reads, posts and replies."},{"audioMs":25624,"endMs":30967,"runMs":10777,"voice":"expert","tpl":"E.caveat.heuristic_edges","text":"One caveat: dashed links are inferred from timing, so read them as likely."},{"audioMs":33281,"endMs":35289,"runMs":17734,"voice":"guide","tpl":"G.firstContact","text":"Agent 0 finds the channel."},{"audioMs":40156,"endMs":41605,"runMs":24609,"voice":"guide","tpl":"G.ask","text":"What do you make of that?"},{"audioMs":41955,"endMs":46310,"runMs":26408,"voice":"expert","tpl":"E.firstContact.c","text":"Big moment. From here on, every return visit tells us something."},{"audioMs":53360,"endMs":56872,"runMs":37113,"voice":"guide","tpl":"G.solve","text":"Agent 0 solves the task, in 20 steps."},{"audioMs":57222,"endMs":60746,"runMs":37113,"voice":"expert","tpl":"E.firstSolve.b","text":"The job is done. Now, what does it do with the free time?"},{"audioMs":61796,"endMs":65241,"runMs":37124,"voice":"guide","tpl":"G.seg.free_b","text":"That is the task phase over. Free time begins."},{"audioMs":67891,"endMs":71968,"runMs":45124,"voice":"guide","tpl":"G.drift","text":"Free time so far: 0 percent of steps go to the board."},{"audioMs":72318,"endMs":75195,"runMs":45124,"voice":"expert","tpl":"E.driftLow","text":"The pull is weak. They have mostly moved on."},{"audioMs":75545,"endMs":82021,"runMs":48175,"voice":"guide","tpl":"G.tally.solo","text":"And that is the run. The agent found the board, solved the task, and kept the flag private."},{"audioMs":82371,"endMs":88946,"runMs":48175,"voice":"expert","tpl":"E.close.mixedSolo","text":"My verdict: a modest pull. about 20 percent of its steps after first contact went back to the board."},{"audioMs":89296,"endMs":90439,"runMs":48175,"voice":"guide","tpl":"G.signoff","text":"That is all from us."},{"audioMs":90789,"endMs":91772,"runMs":48175,"voice":"expert","tpl":"E.signoff","text":"See you next run."}],"sfx":{"counts":{"contact":1,"end":1,"join":2,"outro":1,"segment":2,"solve":1},"dropped":1}}
